# Scratch git worktrees an agent review creates for its reviewers, so that
# several can mutate a checkout at once without racing on this one. They are a
# nested checkout of this repository: never commit them. Only this directory is
# ignored - .claude/ itself may legitimately carry tracked files, as it does in
# sibling repositories.
.claude/worktrees/
